WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:02.970
The gear stopped.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:11.860
Sherry!

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.970
What happened?

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.200
What's this?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.460
Black Rose Dragon protected us.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.300
Sherry, it's not too late to change.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.920
Let's change the future together!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.150
Change the future?

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:40.590
Yeah.  Let's save the city and Yusei.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.560
Crow...  Aki...

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.610
You must live without letting your 
sense of faith and justice waver.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.230
Understood.  I'll go with you.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:00.930
Let's go.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.050
Yusei, are you sure about this?

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.010
Yes.  No matter what awaits us.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.300
Crow, Aki, Lua, Luca and 
Jack, I'm counting on you!

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.830
There's no going back now.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:46.900
Lua...

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.040
Have you become scared?

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.690
Don't worry!

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:58.340
I'd be lying if I said that I wasn't scared, 
but it must be much scarier for Yusei.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.570
A future where Yusei dies...

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:02.980
Forget about that!

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:08.710
We're here to disprove that future!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:12.170
You're right!  I agree!

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:17.800
Besides, we still haven't 
had our deciding match.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.350
I won't let Yusei die.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.080
What is this place?

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.070
This is...

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:52.180
Moment's light?

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.190
This place must be...

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.150
The Yusei Gear?

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.490
Exactly.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.980
No way!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.020
You're...

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:06.910
Aporia!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.060
You're standing on the Yusei Gear.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:18.660
But you won't stop it as long as I'm here.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.010
You?

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.710
What's this?

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.270
I can't take it off!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.410
Piece of junk!

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:44.110
What's the meaning of this?  Let me go now!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.420
It hurts!

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.380
What's going on?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.600
What did you do?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.380
You can no longer escape.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.820
If you try to escape, the 
needles will pierce your heart.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:01.420
What?

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.720
The Yusei Gear and I are one.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:09.150
If you want to stop it, you 
have to defeat me in a duel.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.770
What?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:11.910
No way...

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:17.100
Fine!  Jack Atlas will defeat you!

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.250
Riding Duels.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.410
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:32.270
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:39.960
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:44.330
Is a new legendary duel

00:04:56.840 --> 00:05:01.410
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:07.050
Set free your infinite potential

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:12.490
Every beginning is up to you

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:19.000
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:24.370
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:30.210
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:37.980
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:43.350
Even if you can't see your destination

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:48.890
Run on your feet without fear

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:54.430
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:05:54.870 --> 00:06:01.470
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:21.860
Duel of Despair!
Fortissimo the Mobile Fortress!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.500
Moment is working!

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:29.320
So I'm going to battle too!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:30.850
That's the spirit!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.310
Lua, this is Team 5D's battle!

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.470
Team 5D's...

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.070
I'm fired up!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.010
Luca, I'm gonna give it my all!

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:43.720
Yeah, me too!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.970
Luca...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:55.680
Don't worry!  I promise to protect you, Luca!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.660
Thank you, Lua!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.270
It seems you're ready.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:05.490
Of course!  We'll get past you quickly!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.980
We'll use special tag rules in this duel.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.570
We'll each have 4000 life points.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.810
Your life points are also 4000?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:19.690
Yes.  And I take my turn after 
all three of you take yours.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:25.450
These rules put me at an overwhelming 
disadvantage, but I get to go first.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:26.840
Fine!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.700
Lua and Luca, let's do this!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.860
Yeah!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.780
Let's begin.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.000
Duel!

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:39.350
My turn!

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:47.160
I activate the Field Spell 
Fortissimo the Mobile Fortress.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:24.950
He joined together!

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:30.430
Now we are one with the duel.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:31.430
What?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:36.840
Your life will be converted into numbers 
and linked to your life points.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:42.390
When your life points become 0, 
your life will also become 0.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.370
What?  That means...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.980
We'll die?

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:51.650
Whatever!  I won't let 
you play with our lives!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.860
I'm not playing around.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.110
This is a duel in its truest form.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:09:02.130
If you win, the devices on your chests will 
be removed, and the Yusei Gear will stop.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.920
I will be emotionless in this battle.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.260
Win or lose.  Life or death.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:12.030
I'll become a heartless machine and battle.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.550
Heartless?

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.420
You want to stop being human?

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:24.570
Yes.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.460
You were more human than anyone else.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.980
Three despairs tore apart your life.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:36.730
This sadness created 
three people within you,

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.820
and I resurrected them as 
Lucciano, Placido and Jose.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.840
I no longer need despair.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:50.600
I lost to Team 5D's in the WRGP finals.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.970
Due to this fourth despair, I wanted to die.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.550
That's when you saved me.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:02.460
I lost against my feelings of despair.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.850
I was imprisoned by my feelings.

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.510
So you can have my feelings.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:08.980
Aporia...

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.280
I do not need despair nor hope.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:15.860
I will become a machine.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:22.780
I will become a machine and 
protect you for a better future.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:31.180
That's right.  For a better 
future, I won't let you pass.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.630
I'll drop your life to 0.

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.570
Fortissimo the Mobile 
Fortress's effect activates.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:43.450
Once per turn, I can Special Summon a Level

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:47.390
4-or-below Machine-Type monster 
in my hand on to my field.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:50.930
Come, Meklord Army of Wisel!

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.390
That's...

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.700
A new monster!

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:01.580
Next, I summon Meklord Army of Skiel.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.540
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.990
Another monster!

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.350
I'm up!

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:14.970
Lua!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.860
All right!  I'll show you my skills!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.460
My turn!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:23.890
I summon Morphtronic Staplen 
in defense position!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.700
I flip over my Continuous Trap Level Cannon.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:33.540
When any player summons a 
monster, that player takes

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:37.340
damage equal to that monster's 
Level multiplied by 200 points.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.110
Lua!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.410
Was that a real blast?

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.130
I told you.

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.230
Your life is linked to this duel.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:04.380
If a player loses life points, 
he feels actual pain.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.860
Stop being naive and fight 
with all your strength.

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.930
How dare you!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.280
That's enough!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.850
I'm enough of an opponent for you!

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.950
Let Lua and Luca go!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.660
Answer me!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.500
I'm fine!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:29.310
I was just a little surprised.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.650
It was only 800 points.  I'm totally fine.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.110
Lua...

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.260
But if Luca takes these blasts...

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.080
I set three cards and end my turn!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.910
My turn!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:55.570
If I summon a monster, I'll 
take the same blast as Lua.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.160
Luca!

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.570
Don't worry.  I'll protect you, Luca.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.150
Lua's set cards?

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.700
Does he have a card that 
negates damage effects?

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:11.300
I draw!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.220
I set two cards.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.350
Then I summon Armored White 
Bear in defense position!

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.780
The Continuous Trap Level Cannon activates.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:29.660
Since you summoned a monster, 
you take damage equal to

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.780
its Level multiplied by 200 
points, which is 800 points.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:37.390
I flip over my trap card Damage Eraser!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:43.260
Your card effect's damage is negated, and we 
regain life points equal to the damage instead!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.240
I won't let you lay a finger on Luca!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.280
I activate the Counter Trap Damage Boost.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:54.620
It negates any effect that negates my 
damage effect, and your card is destroyed.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:56.450
No way!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.140
And it doubles the damage.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.610
No!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.680
Luca!

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.700
Luca!

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.520
Are you okay?

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.540
Luca!

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.160
I end my turn.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.650
Due to Fortissimo's effect, 
if you don't control a

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:36.150
Machine-Type monster, you take 100 
points of damage during your End Phase.

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:37.550
What?

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:38.620
Stop it!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.620
Luca!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:57.560
It's my fault.  I stuck my nose where it 
didn't belong, so Luca took all this damage.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.440
Lua!

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.350
Swallow your tears!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.510
Focus on fighting your enemy!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.090
Okay...

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:14.370
We're wagering our lives in this duel, so 
it's hard for Luca because she's physically weak.

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.260
I have to end this fast!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:18.840
My turn!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:24.040
I activate the spell card 
Trap Pause from my hand.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:29.670
Your Continuous Trap's effect 
is negated until the End Phase!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:36.460
And for every negated Continuous 
Trap, I draw one card!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:43.580
I send a Level 4-or-below monster in my hand 
to the graveyard to Special Summon Power Giant!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:54.470
Power Giant's Level decreases by the Level 
of the monster that was sent to the graveyard.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.630
I sent Level 1 Synchro 
Soldier to the graveyard.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.840
Therefore, Power Giant's 
Level changes from 6 to 5!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:05.070
Then I summon Dark Resonator!

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.750
Here I go!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:13.750
Level 3 Dark Resonator 
tunes Level 5 Power Giant!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.490
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.150
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.890
Synchro Summon!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:26.240
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.090
He did it!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:30.340
Jack is incredible!

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:34.570
I have to become stronger 
if I want to protect Luca.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.230
Because I'm not...

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.710
So I'll do what I can!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:42.890
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Power-Up Adapter!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:49.580
This card equips on to a Morphtronic 
monster, and the equipped monster can't attack!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.100
I equip Power-Up Adapter on Staplen!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:58.460
Staplen's attack points are 
added to a monster on the field!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.520
I select Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.000
Take it, Jack!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:10.630
Staplen's 1400 attack points are 
added to Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:16.200
Interesting.  How clever.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:20.740
However, I flip over my 
trap card Power Gravity.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:27.020
When your monster's attack points change, 
those points are added to my monster.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:31.420
And your monster's attack points become 0.

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.620
What?

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.600
Oh no!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.560
It's my fault again.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.980
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.610
You'll take Fortissimo's 
effect during the End Phase.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:54.700
Jack...

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:58.810
I'm sorry.  I didn't mean for that to happen!

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.150
Stop crying!

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.690
Don't lose your cool over a minor setback!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.730
Stand up!  Concentrate and be strong!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.170
But what can I do?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.420
You're not the only one who's hurting.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:14.540
Lua!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:18.550
I'm fine, so let's try our best!

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:22.720
Luca...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.560
I'm a pathetic brother.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.670
Luca always needs to encourage me.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.560
My turn.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:35.470
When I only have one card 
in my hand, I can activate

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:39.230
the spell card Aurora Draw and 
draw two cards from my deck.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.910
I summon Meklord Army of Granel.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:56.410
Since I summoned a monster, I take 800 points of 
damage due to Continuous Trap Level Cannon's effect.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.420
You don't feel any pain?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.920
I activate Meklord Army of Granel's effect.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:15.440
Once per turn, your monster's attack 
points or defense points are halved.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:19.680
I halve Armored White Bear's defense points.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.830
Gravity Pressure!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:35.780
Meklord Army of Wisel attacks Red Dragon 
Archfiend, which has 0 attack points.

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.550
Quark Curb!

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.100
He lost 3200 life points!

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:01.240
Jack!

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:07.490
Due to Meklord Army of Wisel's effect, 
Meklord Army of Skiel can deal piercing damage.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.690
Attack Armored White Bear.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:11.790
Twin Pulse!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.110
Luca!

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:24.090
Then Meklord Army of Granel 
attacks Luca directly.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.350
Don't do it!

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.290
Gravity Blaster!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.610
Luca!

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.310
No, Luca is...

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.300
Jack...

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:48.610
Why is this happening?

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:55.040
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Lock On Laser from my hand.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:03.870
If you set a card in the Spell & Trap Card 
Zone, you takes 200 points of damage.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:11.540
The more moves you make, 
the more life you'll pay.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.310
Bringing you closer to the end.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.920
Those two can't move anymore.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:24.040
Does your heart hurt?

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.750
Humans hold on to foolish 
hopes because of their hearts.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:32.880
Those hopes are easily destroyed, 
leaving them squirming in pain.

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:34.370
Pathetic.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.800
If you didn't have hearts, the future 
wouldn't have been destroyed.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:43.240
Kid, this is despair.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.770
I end my turn.

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:11.880
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:17.250
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:22.620
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:25.360
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:30.600
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:37.240
We'll find a place for us

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:43.980
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:49.050
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.780 --> 00:22:55.220
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:55.220 --> 00:23:03.800
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:03.800 --> 00:23:09.400
We will draw it forever
